WEBVTT

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.240
As always,

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.680
Rock Lee spends his day working hard...

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:36.170
...to achieve his dream of
becoming an outstanding ninja,

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.820
despite not being able to use ninjutsu.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.320
However...

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.770
He's also working hard 
in the world of romance!

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:46.100
This is Sakura Haruno.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.450
She's a member of Naruto's team,

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:53.670
and, well, she's the target of our
dear Lee's amorous affection!

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.660
What pretty flowers...

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.630
Sakura!

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:02.260
How about going on a date with me?!

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.530
Sorry, I, um...

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.020
I'm not into thick eyebrows.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.030
<b>Love is a Part
of the Springtime of Youth!</b>

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.000
Why?

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:31.710
Sakura turned me down again...

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.700
Get a grip.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:37.370
She just said no to a date.  That's no
reason to be so beat up about it.

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.860
I-I'm not beat up.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.680
My heart is just unprotected,

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:44.390
and she landed a critical hit...

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.520
And you're saying it was fatal.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:52.690
If you ask me, this just proves
that guys don't get how women think.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.070
Who in their right mind 
would be enamored by...

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:57.860
...someone jumping in front 
of them and blowing a kiss?

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:00.840
Oh?! Then what should I 
do to make her swoon?!

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.460
Don't ask me.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:05.410
Although my advice would be 
to try and play it cool.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:07.850
Play it... cool?

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:18.940
I have no idea where you get 
your sense of "cool" from.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.040
So how am I supposed to act, then?

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.090
It's not that simple to explain.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.130
All right.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:28.180
I'll set up a scenario where a woman
can reveal her true feelings.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.000
Dressing Room
LNT 48 Group

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.610
Why am I doing this?

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.270
These days it's all about me...

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:47.390
Ah, I mean Korea!

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.710
I think Jang Tonsuk's the coolest!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.250
Who's your favorite, Nejimi?

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:55.460
I-I like Mukai Bosamu.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.770
Yeah, the "Bosamu" is 
kinda Korean, I guess!

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.890
And who's your type, Tenko?

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.990
Well, it's not enough for 
them to just look good.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.210
What do you mean?

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:07.500
He's gotta be naturally kind,

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.290
give me lots of presents 
to keep me happy...

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.750
Oh, and be honest and 
open about his feelings,

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.850
but maybe a little forceful 
every now and then...

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:18.770
That's the man for me!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.480
I see!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.500
It was worth the trouble 
to cast that genjutsu!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.620
What genjutsu?

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.770
That was just us doing a skit.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:30.260
Naturally kind, keep her 
happy with presents,

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:33.910
be open and honest, and a 
little forceful at times.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.650
That's what a real cool guy is like, right?

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:38.750
Uh... I guess so, yeah...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.150
Understood!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:43.330
I'll use your teachings to become
the coolest cool guy out there!

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:46.220
And then I'll launch another
attack on Sakura!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.960
I hope he'll be okay...

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.040
Hey!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.570
What's wrong, Naruto?

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:53.490
I'm out warning people.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:56.370
Apparently there are rogue foreign ninja
hiding in the outskirts of the village.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.770
By the way, where's Bushy-Brows?

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.310
On a one-man journey of love.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:02.280
Say what?

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.750
Hey, Naruto, what would you 
say makes a man "cool"?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.030
That's easy!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.890
Treating people to ramen.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.620
Serves me right for asking.

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:16.960
I dunno. People who protect those
who are important to them, I guess.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.160
Maybe I'll take a break.

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.080
Hang on, Sakura.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:33.810
Lee?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:38.540
<i>First part of being a cool 
guy: Natural kindness!</i>

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:41.230
This bench is filthy. 
Let me clean it up for you.

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:47.070
<i>If I did this a little harder 
it'd be great arm training!</i>

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.660
Wow, you must love cleaning!

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:51.990
All set!

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:57.670
Lee!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:58.360
Tenten?

00:05:58.360 --> 00:05:59.480
Lee, listen—

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.630
I understand.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.000
You're here to see me acting cool, right?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:03.940
Good timing!

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.870
I'm applying the lessons on how
to be cool that you taught me,

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.270
and everything's going great!

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:10.550
No, no, there's a rogue—

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.800
But I'm just getting started.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:13.930
Watch this!

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:15.600
Wait— Jeez...

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:21.030
<i>Second part of being a cool guy:</i>

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.930
<i>Keep her happy with presents!</i>

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:25.180
Sakura, these are for you.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:29.950
What?!

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.360
Bees!

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.250
I like the flowers, but bees!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.120
Don't worry.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.870
I'll pound them all with 
pinpoint precision punches!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.290
<i>He's pounding Sakura!</i>

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:45.150
What on earth is wrong with you, Lee?

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.490
I'm sorry!

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:48.880
I wasn't trying to hit you, Sakura...

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.220
<i>That was a complete disaster.</i>

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.400
<i>I'll have to move on.</i>

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.750
<i>Third part of being a cool guy:</i>

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.470
<i>Be open and honest 
about your feelings.</i>

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.310
A-Actually, Sakura,
I need to talk to you.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.960
This is hard to put into words, but...

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.270
<i>Lee?</i>

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:10.410
You nasty beast!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:13.750
Nasty beast?

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:17.360
That's what you wanted to tell me?!

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.820
<i>It's getting worse.</i>

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:25.840
<i>My only choice is the fourth 
part of being a cool guy.</i>

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:29.010
<i>Maybe a little forceful 
every now and then...</i>

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:33.150
<i>I'll have to force a kiss on
her to steal her heart!</i>

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.180
Don't try this at home, kids.

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.140
Sakura.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.620
Hell no!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:47.070
Lee, you jerk! Stay away from me!

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.530
What in the world got into him?

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:59.580
Still, maybe I was a little 
too harsh back there...

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.710
D-Don't be so upset, Lee.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.900
Sure, things went off the rails,

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.040
but that's no reason 
to act like a sad sack!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.330
<i>Sad sack...</i>

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.420
<b>Sad 
Sack
(sakuran)</b>

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:10.760
<b>Sakura</b>

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:10.760
<i>Sakura...</i>

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.590
Anyway, you just need to regroup 
and take another crack at it!

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.890
<b>Crack
(saku)</b>

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:14.840
<i>Crack...</i>

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.180
<i>Sakura...</i>

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.180
<b>Sakura</b>

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:19.710
Come on, cheer up!

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:21.100
The Lee I know would bounce right back!

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.600
<b>Back
(rashiku)</b>

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:22.770
Back...

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:23.770
<b>(shikura)</b>

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:23.800
<i>Sak...</i>

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.360
<b>Sakura</b>

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.250
<i>Sakura...</i>

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.020
<i>Sakura!</i>

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.090
<i>It's no use, he's just 
getting more depressed!</i>

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:31.130
<i>Plus he kinda forced that last one!</i>

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:32.870
There you two are.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:33.700
Neji?

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.030
Did you forget about what Naruto told us?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:41.950
<i>Apparently there are rogue foreign ninjas
hiding in the outskirts of the village.</i>

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:46.140
That's right. It totally slipped my mind.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:48.570
He was last spotted somewhere over there.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:49.710
What did you say?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:50.460
But that's where...

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.570
Sakura!

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.100
You are shock!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.390
There's no need to strip!

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.720
Hey! Lee!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.640
We can't let you live now 
that you've spotted us.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.990
<i>What do I do? They've 
got me outnumbered...</i>

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.410
Die!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:26.560
<b>Hornet Stinger!!</b>

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:25.010
Hornet Stinger!

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:28.880
Lee...

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.250
Give me a minute...

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:34.880
You made yourself dizzy!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.940
Who's this guy? Where'd he come from?

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:39.250
Who cares? Take him out!

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.140
Lee!

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.070
It's okay.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.310
Just sit tight and watch!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.390
Hornet Stinger! Hi-ya!

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.320
<i>Does he really need to spin?</i>

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.120
And that takes care of that...

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.740
Lee, why did you...

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:03.620
I said such mean things to you...

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.330
It doesn't matter.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:11.420
I don't need a reason to protect
the people that are dear to me!

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:17.130
Let's go home, Sakura.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.310
Oh, hell no!

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:37.950
Tenten...

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:44.340
So you blew it, huh?

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:45.400
Yeah...

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.620
I guess I'm just not cool.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:51.540
That's not true, you're plenty cool!

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.730
After all, you protected 
your friend, didn't you?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.970
Tenten!

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:08.500
I'm sorry!

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:14.400
A journey down the road of love 
cannot be completed in a day.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.140
Remember, everyone, sometimes 
it's best to play it cool.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.690
A great poet once wrote,

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:33.280
"Love makes both people 
do crazy things."

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:39.570
So, will the same happen to Rock Lee
and the girl he has a crush on?

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.890
How can I get Sakura to like me?

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.570
You're just too forward, Lee.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:49.580
Why don't you try a more subtle angle?

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.570
Ankle?

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.350
Angle!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.210
Use a more casual approach,

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.090
maybe send her a present or a letter.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:58.440
In fact, what about a love letter?

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:00.650
A love letter!

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:10.680
<b>Love Makes Both Sides Crazy</b>

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:26.440
This is perfect!

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.470
Now she'll—

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.430
What's this?

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.570
"Dear Sakura,

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:35.790
To me, you are the pickled vegetables
that come with curry and rice.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.960
Just thinking about curry 
without the side vegetables...

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:40.960
...reminds me of the time I got 
homesick at summer camp,

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.840
because they didn't make 
curry like my mom did.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:48.390
It's enough to move me to tears."

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:50.320
What is he trying to say?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.420
It's poetry, sheer poetry!

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.490
Who wrote me this wonderfully 
romantic letter?

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:58.980
And sent this beautiful present?

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.920
That would be me!

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:03.940
Lee...

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:06.340
No one's ever said such 
beautiful things to me!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.690
Lee...

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:09.990
Sakura...

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:10.750
Lee...

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:11.770
Sakura...

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.140
I'm yours.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.650
Your face, your face!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.910
All according to plan so far.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.280
Now to wait until she reads it...

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:32.410
Wha—

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:36.960
That's not the letter I wrote!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.420
W-W-What's going on here?!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.590
Someone else sent one?!

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:45.380
And look how happy she is.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:49.640
That means she's excited about 
someone else's love letter!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.690
Farewell, my youth...

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:54.910
Hello, crushing adulthood...

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:57.850
It's only the second episode and
I've already lost the heroine forever.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:00.470
What's wrong, Bushy-Brows?

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.270
You look really depressed.

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:06.450
Is that—

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.780
Yes. It's a love letter 
from someone else...

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.290
Someone else?!

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.860
Who is it?!

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:15.290
I don't know, but Sakura...

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.780
Look how happy it's made her...

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:26.200
That's right...

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.340
You like Sakura, too, 
don't you, Naruto?

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:31.010
Man, we're like two peas 
in a pod over here, huh?

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.280
We most certainly are not!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.220
Sakura will be mine—

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.640
Excuse me? It's gonna be me who—

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.290
Look, Bushy-Brows,

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:44.550
fighting with each other
isn't gonna help things.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.320
So what are we supposed to do?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.030
I think I've got an idea.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:15:00.590
Okay, all we have to do is steal the
letter before Sakura reads it.

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:01.740
Right.

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:03.990
That way she'll never know what it said,

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:06.060
and the truth will be "lost for words."

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:08.560
I think you mean "lost in translation."

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.380
No, it's "lost to the ages!"

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:14.100
Okay, I'll blast Sakura's 
bag right off her shoulder!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.100
Wind Style:

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:18.440
<i>I thought he couldn't use ninjutsu!</i>

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:19.690
<i>When did he learn...</i>

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.610
Leaf Revolution!

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:23.400
That blows!

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:29.140
There's not nearly enough wind.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:30.280
Leave this to me!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.370
Naruto, what are you...

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.390
If you're gonna snatch someone's purse,

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:42.270
you need the heat of the sun,

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:45.650
Please don't imitate Naruto, kids!

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.570
not a gust of wind!

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.210
At least I remember 
reading that somewhere.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.580
Boy, it's hot all of a sudden.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.890
<i>Sakura put her handbag down!</i>

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:04.630
<i>Nice work, Naruto!</i>

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.980
With both your hands busy, 
that was all pointless.

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:12.700
Hang on, hang on.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.740
I still have my secret backup plan—

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:19.150
Why didn't my alarm go off?

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:22.240
I'm gonna be late for the 
first day of school!

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.080
Keep it up, Bushy-Brows!

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.170
Jeez, watch where you're going.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.680
Transfer
Student
Sakura
Haruno

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:42.640
You!

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:44.650
I call this my,

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.500
"Smash into her while running 
to school and eating toast...

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.440
...on the morning of the 
first day of school...

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.640
...then see her again in homeroom 
and point and shout 'You!'"

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:51.990
back-up plan!

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:07.290
I'm sorry, ma'am!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.500
Are you hurt?

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:14.800
Hold on tight, I'll get 
you to the hospital!

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:18.220
Bushy-Brows, you're killing me...

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.850
This is getting us nowhere fast.

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:25.880
All we've done is put 
her on guard even more.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:29.390
At this rate, she won't even 
want to open her handbag.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:30.740
Open her handbag...

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.650
That's it, Naruto!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:33.260
Huh?

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.740
We'll have her open it for us!

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:40.240
Yo, Haruno!

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:44.410
We need to inspect your bag.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.600
What?

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:47.750
Wait, who are you?

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.850
We're guidance counselors who're here...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.730
...to put a stop to un-ninja-like 
behavior in our village.

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:55.560
Err, ninjas, not counselors.

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:57.380
Guidance... ninjas?

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:59.660
We need to take a look in your bag,

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.000
because we've had a lot 
of problems with people...

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.430
...carrying around items unrelated 
to their missions lately...

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.020
Like... Like...

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:08.600
Like chicken wings!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.870
Sorry for the trouble, 
now let's see here...

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:11.860
H-Hey!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:16.360
<i>Nope...</i>

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.660
<i>It's not in here, Naruto!</i>

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.290
<i>What're you doing, Bushy-Brows!</i>

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:20.810
Hurry it up!

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:22.250
I'm trying to tell you—

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.210
Are we done here?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.680
J-Just a m-moment...

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:26.770
<i>Faster, Bushy-Brows!</i>

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:28.760
<i>Wait, just a bit more.</i>

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.580
<i>A-Are these...</i>

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.000
<i>Sakura's...</i>

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.930
<i>...panties?!</i>

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:43.060
<i>No, no, this isn't the time!</i>

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:46.560
<i>I have to find that love letter!</i>

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:51.750
<i>But this may be the only chance I ever
have to see them in all their glory...</i>

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.230
<i>What the heck is wrong with me?</i>

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:58.280
<i>Naruto would be disgusted with me!</i>

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.930
<i>I'm sure that even with these panties 
staring him right in the eye,</i>

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.830
<i>Naruto is completely focused 
on finding that love letter!</i>

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:06.580
<i>He's completely focused on the panties!</i>

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:07.990
<i>Naruto!</i>

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:09.620
<i>R-Right...</i>

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.560
Can you hurry up?

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:13.290
J-Just another moment or two...

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:17.060
It looks like you need some guidance.

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:17.790
Haruno!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.440
You're hiding something from us!

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:20.840
L-Like what?

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:24.190
That reaction just proves it.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.670
If you've got black panties in there,

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:29.010
you must have a black bra, too.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:30.710
You're only a chunin.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:31.600
You're much too young for that sort of thing!

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:38.530
The hell did you say?!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.700
Oh, no, I sent them flying!

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.550
A stomach wrap?!

00:19:57.940 --> 00:19:59.830
That's so misleading!

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:01.350
Wait, why does she have a stomach wrap?!

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:04.610
Actually, she said her stomach 
had been bothering her lately...

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:06.960
Well, forget the panties, even 
if the plan was a bust,

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:08.510
we've finally got her handbag!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.100
Now...

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:12.850
All that's left is to grab the 
love letter that other guy wrote!

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.610
Are those slices of naruto rolls?

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:23.950
Pickled vegetables for curry?

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.910
Wait, that's mine!

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:31.230
What're you two doing over here?

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.150
We, uh...

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.870
Did you see any letters fly over here?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.990
I got two love letters today!

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:40.090
No idea who sent them, though...

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:45.020
I wanted to read them later, too...

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:48.170
Don't tell me...

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:50.000
The other person was you, Naruto?

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.110
Bushy-Brows, you...

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:55.440
Let me explain.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:21:00.140
Actually, both of them snuck a love
letter into Sakura's handbag!

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:03.970
Man...

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:14.600
So they had no idea and ended 
up destroying both letters?

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.100
They're so dumb.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:18.920
Did it hurt their friendship at all?

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:21.760
No, apparently just the opposite.

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:23.720
Why do you say that?

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:28.850
Because now they're both working
hard on a single, brand-new letter.

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:32.310
We need to put more emphasis 
on curry in this section.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.270
No, no, no. I'm telling you, a sentence
about ramen fits perfectly here!

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:39.470
"Love makes both people 
do crazy things."

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:43.290
That was certainly true 
today... for Lee and Naruto.

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:27.860
<b>A Competition with the Genius Ninja, Neji 
Tenten's Must-Win Battle</b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:24.100
Next week, "A Competition with 
the Genius Ninja, Neji,"

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:27.340
and "Tenten's Must-Win Battle!"

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:29.710
Now, let's do this, Neji!

00:23:29.710 --> 00:23:30.160
Wait—

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:31.360
Leaf Whirlwind!

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:31.910
Wait!

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:32.930
Eight Trigrams Rotation!

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:35.020
The fight is next week!
